00:01:28.185 --> 00:01:30.780
They ain't got time for that.
- Not a joking matter.

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:32.720
So as usual these questions

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:34.970
are collected from our internet fanbase.

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:37.420
- Yes.
- From Instagram, Twitter.

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:39.270
- Facebook.
- And Facebook, very cool.

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:40.580
- A guy on the street.
- Yeah.

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:43.470
- It's totally legit.
- And I don't know if you're

