00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:55.850
- Yeah, exactly, I mean, they don't know.

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:57.200
They're not gonna bust
in the door and be like--

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.287
- No one else will know, you'll mean.

00:01:58.287 --> 00:01:59.250
They'll know, no one else will know.

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:00.310
- Yeah, they'll know.

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:01.380
