00:02:17.350 --> 00:02:21.190
Blessed be his name, Yaneev
is pronounced like Yaneev

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:22.839
and it rhymes with achieve.

00:02:22.839 --> 00:02:24.404
That's what it says on the question.

00:02:24.404 --> 00:02:26.340
- Yaneev, good, mm-hmm.
- Although he addresses it

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:28.940
