00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:19.420
- Oh yeah, I remember that.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:22.070
I love that introduction.
- Yeah, that's all it is.

00:05:22.070 --> 00:05:24.780
And I put it in that book
